Description: privileged system capture helper for Ubuntu Backup
 Captures root-owned and other-user configuration into a verified cache inside
 the invoking user's Ubuntu Backup workspace. It is intended for the strict
 Ubuntu Backup snap and for the packaged GUI.
 .
 The helper runs only through pkexec or the request watcher. It never edits
 /etc while capturing; restore actions remain explicit. There is no scheduled
 root timer; capture is on-demand.

